				},
				{
					"id": 730740302,
					"content": "这就是兰雅玛留下的歌…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740303,
					"content": "「纵使那是铺满火的道路，也要欢歌前行…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740304,
					"content": "「纵使那日的月色，如同垂死之兽的眼眸…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740305,
					"content": "「因为我们确是生命之谷的居民，因为我们确是勇敢的种子。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740306,
					"content": "这就是…我们找到的歌吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740307,
					"content": "「因为有想要结实的石榴，因为有想要盛放的蔷薇。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740308,
					"content": "「遥远而比邻的天空…永不终结的约定…一定会归还梦的笼城。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740309,
					"content": "…嗯。原来如此，我大致明白了。只要有兰雅玛的歌，就能消除前往觉树之堂通路上的阻碍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740310,
						730740312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740310,
					"content": "我也明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730740311,
					"content": "欸？你明白了什么…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740313,
					"content": "当然是兰雅玛的歌。嗯，还是说，不是兰那罗的话，没那么容易听懂…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740314,
					"content": "嗯，不管怎么说，兰陀娑，你先回去准备无忧节吧？觉树之堂交给我就好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740315,
					"content": "♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740316,
					"content": "#我和{NICKNAME}也一起去！毕竟，说好了要帮忙拿到恒素果的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740317,
					"content": "「…一定要欢歌前行。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "兰陀娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730740312,
					"content": "怎么明白的…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730740313
					]
				}
			]
