					"nextDialogs": [
						730741707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730741707,
					"content": "宝藏就是很珍贵的东西的意思。你看，恒素果有很多梦想和记忆，而且能让兰那罗恢复力量，很厉害、很稀有对吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730741708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730741708,
					"content": "像恒素果这样，很珍贵、很重要的东西，这就是宝藏喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730741709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730741709,
					"content": "哦哦！原来宝藏是这样的意思…我知道了！谢谢派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730741710,
						730741712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730741710,
					"content": "接下来要做什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730741711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730741711,
					"content": "唔…记得之前兰拉迦说了，好像要不止一个恒素果。这样的话，我们还要找别的觉树之堂吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730741714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730741714,
					"content": "#嗯。我会努力！那菈{NICKNAME}、派蒙，我们之后再见吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730741715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰罗摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730741715,
					"content": "嗯！之后再见啦，兰罗摩！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730741712,
					"content": "谢谢派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730741713
					]
				},
				{
